@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontSize 18
skinparam sequenceMessageFontSize 17
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam sequenceGroupFontSize 17
skinparam ParticipantPadding 30
skinparam BoxPadding 12
skinparam ArrowColor #6E512E
skinparam LifeLineBorderColor #9D835F
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #B97824
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFF5E7
skinparam ActorBorderColor #B97824
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
autonumber

actor 用户 as User
boundary "笔记界面" as UI
control "笔记服务" as Notes
control "原文定位器" as Locator
database "笔记仓库" as Repo
control "审计服务" as Audit

User -> UI : 从原文或回答创建笔记
UI -> Notes : 提交正文、标签和来源引用
Notes -> Locator : 核验文档版本与原文锚点

alt 锚点有效
  Locator --> Notes : 返回版本、页码、段落与字符范围
else 定位漂移或版本变化
  Locator --> Notes : 返回stale及需复核原因
end

Notes -> Repo : 保存Note、来源版本和锚点状态
Repo --> Notes : 返回note_id
Notes -> Audit : 记录创建者、来源与保存结果
Audit --> Notes : 确认留痕
Notes --> UI : 返回已保存或需复核状态
UI --> User : 保留笔记内容并提示来源状态
@enduml
